                <pb facs="0952" n="864" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg864"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-05-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 2, 1903</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 173.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have been informed by the Venezuelan
                    Government that Dr. Jose de Jesus Paul has been appointed the representative of
                    Venezuela on the mixed commission which is to consider the claims of the United
                    States. Doctor Paul is also the Venezuelan member of the mixed commission for
                    the French claims.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William W.
                    Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
